            "detailed_description": "Project Alpha 002 - First person shooter with survival elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn our Game, players are put into a world that is inhabited by a variety of animals and zombies. <br />\r\nYour survival will be determined by your skills to stay alive, craft a shelter or base, start a fire before night falls <br />\r\nand gather resources like meat, water, wood,stone or iron. Meat and Water could be the most vital supplies you can possess.<br />\r\nAbandoned wilderness awaits you, every day is a struggle to survive.<br />\r\nFight against hunger, the nature and the remaining residents.<br />\r\nCollect resources to build a fortress, gain experience to earn supply drops.<br />\r\nGame Includes Survival,Story and Hunted mode.",
            "about_the_game": "Project Alpha 002 - First person shooter with survival elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn our Game, players are put into a world that is inhabited by a variety of animals and zombies. <br />\r\nYour survival will be determined by your skills to stay alive, craft a shelter or base, start a fire before night falls <br />\r\nand gather resources like meat, water, wood,stone or iron. Meat and Water could be the most vital supplies you can possess.<br />\r\nAbandoned wilderness awaits you, every day is a struggle to survive.<br />\r\nFight against hunger, the nature and the remaining residents.<br />\r\nCollect resources to build a fortress, gain experience to earn supply drops.<br />\r\nGame Includes Survival,Story and Hunted mode.",
